#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:1
msgid "Cached task"
msgstr "缓存任务"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:4
msgid ""
"This page covers the cached task details. See [Caching](../concepts/"
"caching.md) for a general explanation."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍缓存任务的细节。有关一般说明，请参阅[缓存](../concepts/caching.md)。"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:6
msgid "Automatic caching"
msgstr "自动缓存"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:10
#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:68
#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:75
#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:83
msgid "\"something\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:12
