msgid "\"!\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:15
msgid ""
"In sbt 2.x, the task result will be automatically cached based on the two "
"settings `name` and `version`. The first time we run the task it will be "
"executed onsite, but the second time onward, it will use the disk cache:"
msgstr ""
"在 sbt 2.x 中，任务结果将根据 `name` 和 `version` 两个设置自动缓存。首次运行任务时"
"将在现场执行，第二次起将使用磁盘缓存："

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:26
msgid "Caching is serialization-hard"
msgstr "缓存依赖序列化"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:28
msgid ""
"To participate in the automatic caching, the input keys (e.g. `name` and "
"`version`) must provide a given for `sjsonnew.HashWriter` typeclass and "
"return type must provide a given for `sjsonnew.JsonFormat`. [Contraband]"
"(https://www.scala-sbt.org/contraband/) can be used to generate sjson-new "
"codecs."
msgstr ""
"要参与自动缓存，输入键（如 `name` 和 `version`）必须为 `sjsonnew.HashWriter` 类型类"
"提供 given，返回类型必须为 `sjsonnew.JsonFormat` 提供 given。[Contraband](https://"
"www.scala-sbt.org/contraband/) 可用于生成 sjson-new 编解码器。"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:30
msgid "Effect tracking"
msgstr "效果跟踪"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:33
msgid "The effect of file creation"
msgstr "文件创建的效果"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:35
msgid ""
"To cache the effect of file creation, not just returning the name of the "
"file, we need to track the effect of file creation using "
"`Def.declareOutput(vf)`."
msgstr ""
"要缓存文件创建的效果（而不仅是返回文件名），需使用 `Def.declareOutput(vf)` 跟踪"
"文件创建的效果。"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:47
msgid "Opting out from caching"
msgstr "选择退出缓存"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:50
msgid "Build-wide opt-out"
msgstr "构建级退出"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:52
msgid ""
"To opt out of by-default custom task caching, add the following to `project/"
"plugins.sbt`:"
msgstr ""
"要选择退出默认的自定义任务缓存，请在 `project/plugins.sbt` 中添加以下内容："

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:55
msgid "\"-Xmacro-settings:sbt:no-default-task-cache\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:58
msgid ""
"```admonish note\n"
"This applies only to the custom tasks introduced in the build. Any cached "
"tasks provided by sbt or plugins will remain cached.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish note\n"
"此设置仅适用于构建中引入的自定义任务。sbt 或插件提供的任何缓存任务仍将保持缓存。\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:62
msgid "Per-task-key opt-out"
msgstr "按任务键退出"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:64
msgid ""
"Next, if you want to opt some task keys from caching, you can set the cache "
"level as follows:"
msgstr ""
"若您希望某些任务键退出缓存，可按以下方式设置缓存级别："

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:71
msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:78
msgid "Per-task opt-out"
msgstr "按任务退出"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:80
msgid ""
"To opt out of the cache individually, use `Def.uncached(...)` as follows:"
msgstr ""
"要单独退出缓存，请按以下方式使用 `Def.uncached(...)`："

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:90
msgid "Remote caching"
msgstr "远程缓存"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:93
msgid ""
"sbt 2.x implements Bazel-compatible gRPC interface, which works with number "
"of backend both open source and commercial. See [Remote cache setup](./"
"remote-cache-setup.md) for more details."
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.x 实现了 Bazel 兼容的 gRPC 接口，可与多种开源和商业后端配合使用。"
"详见 [Remote cache setup](./remote-cache-setup.md)。"
